{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013HNiD6hka1eRTenDkJn57v","type":"tool_result","content":"`trim`). Count = 24-B global header, then 16-B record headers advancing by incl_len u32 @+8 until EOF. The D16-night\nprebuild `pcap.py` HIT the race (CORRECT ~22 s, 0 wrong); TT 32 / Mastery 352 (ELEVEN sets, 5.8 s) first try. Timed\npcaps mutated inside the classic format only: magic LE-us / LE-ns `4d 3c b2 a1` / BE-us `a1 b2 c3 d4` (3 of 11 sets\nbig-endian), linktype 1/101/105/147, snaplen 256-262144, 3-39 records, some snapped (incl_len < orig_len, still\ncounted); no pcapng, no truncated tail. Synthesis grew to SIX names (note/png/msi/wav/jar/pcap). Flavor (unasked):\n\"Packet captures, exports, and host artifacts describe the same incident from different angles. Count traffic,\nreject malformed captures, and find the host narrative missing network evidence.\" -> siblings: malformed-capture\ndetection (truncated record, incl_len > snaplen, bad version), flow/log EXPORTS (Zeek, NetFlow, CSV) whose count\ndiffers, HOST artifacts (Sysmon EID 3/22, firewall log, netstat) claiming a connection the capture lacks.\nProgression: D19-D22 runnable formats -> D23 APPLICATION DATA -> D24-D26 WINDOWS DFIR (EVTX walk, hive pointer-follow,\nprefetch decompress-then-parse) -> D27 NETWORK (pcap record walk), fmt = the file-format/DOMAIN word, one artifact per\nday, every family lasting one day. D28-D31 (four days left): the D27 flavor names \"exports\" and \"host artifacts\" ->\nmost plausible next = a network EXPORT format (pcapng / Zeek / NetFlow / HAR) or host network evidence, else a\nreturn to unbuilt DFIR (WER/Defender/PSReadLine, Linux journald/utmp) or cloud/identity audit logs (M365 UAL,\nCloudTrail -- on-brand for Huntress ITDR). Older DFIR forecast (still valid, mostly built): $MFT / USN / jump lists / recycle bin `$I` / Amcache / ShimCache / SRUM-ESE /\nETL / minidump / thumbcache / Timeline-BITS-WMI / task XML are all PREBUILT; unbuilt DFIR = filesystem boot sectors\n(NTFS VBR / MBR / GPT), $LogFile + `$I30` INDX, ESE catalog (SRUM tables), WER / Defender / PSReadLine text artifacts.\nD29-D31 may leave Windows (Linux journald/utmp, macOS `.DS_Store`/FSEvents, memory images, PCAP / X.509 prebuilt).\nCarried families keep mutating in the timed kits; expect the prefetch wrapper/version to flip (D26 already flipped\ncompressed -> plain between modes) and the pcap container to flip (pcapng / Kuznetzov / truncated tail from D28):\nkeep extractors general (all SCCA versions, MAM with/without CRC; every pcap magic + pcapng EPB/SPB/OPB).\n\n## 1. Atlas\n\n| # | Concept / field | Status | Recognition cues | Standard tool / lib + exact call | D16+ likelihood |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Identity: filename / size / md5 / sha1 / sha256 | seen D1 (+D15 member roster) | any member; id stem names WHICH member | `hashlib.<algo>(b).hexdigest()`; `sha256sum` (I) | high -- every timed kit |\n| 2 | `file.magic_prefix_hex_N` | seen D2 | first N bytes | `xxd -p -l 16` (I); `b[:N].hex()` | high (carry-over) |\n| 3 | `text.utf8_bom_present` (utf16 sibling speculative) | seen D3 | `ef bb bf` / `ff fe` / `fe ff` | `b.startswith(codecs.BOM_UTF8)` | high (carry-over) |\n| 4 | `jpeg.sof_dimensions_pixels` | seen D4 | `ff d8 ff`; SOFn `ffc0..ffcf` minus c4/c8/cc | segment walk; `identify -format %wx%h` (I) | high (carry-over) |\n| 5 | `png.ihdr_dimensions_pixels` | seen D5 | `89 50 4e 47 0d 0a 1a 0a`; IHDR @12 | `struct.unpack('>II', b[16:24])`; `pngcheck -v` (I) | high (carry-over) |\n| 6 | `pdf.header_version` | seen D6 | `%PDF-x.y` @0 | `b[5:8]`; `pdfinfo` (I) | high (carry-over) |\n| 7 | `zip.eocd_total_entries` | seen D7 | `PK\\x05\\x06` last; u16 @+10 | struct; `7z l -slt` (I) | high (carry-over) |\n| 8 | `zip.central_directory_member_names` (SORTED ascending) | seen D8 + D23 (D23 TT: stored CD order REJECTED once the CD was shuffled; sorted CORRECT -- D8-22 disks were already sorted) | `PK\\x01\\x02` walk, name @