A/count/size (never hard-code 2/128/128), skip zero type-GUID entries, emit first_lba u64 @+32 per entry in TABLE\n  order as compact JSON integers (not strings, not byte offsets). MBR fallback incl. the EBR chain is in the solver.\n- Tools: `xxd -s 0x1be -l 66 f.img` (protective `ee`), `xxd -s 512 -l 92`, `xxd -s 1024 -l 128`; `sfdisk -d f.img` /\n  `fdisk -l` cross-check; ~25-line python `struct` walk (`disk_partition_starts` in the day's solver).\n- Time: GM CORRECT ~22 s after start, 0 wrong. Race MISS: lib had the GPT walk (`vbr.py`) but under fmts\n  `gpt`/`mbr`/`partition_table` with field `partition_start_lbas`, and lib's `disk` fmt = virtual-disk containers\n  (VHD/VMDK/QCOW2) -> live worker added `local_answer`. TT 33 fields 3.2 s (solve 0.9) + Mastery 396 = TWELVE sets\n  4.3 s (solve 2.1), first submit, no generalize. Timed images varied only in size / entry count (1-6) / start LBAs.\n\n\"\"\"\ns=s[:a]+new+s[b:]\n# conventions\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"  walked (D27; snapped incl_len < orig_len records count; pcapng = EPB+SPB+OPB, unverified).\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  walked (D27; snapped incl_len < orig_len records count; pcapng = EPB+SPB+OPB, unverified).\n- LBAs (D28): decimal JSON INTEGERS in sectors (`[34]`, `[60,93,148]`), not byte offsets, not quoted. `_sequence` =\n  an ORDER the field names -> partition-table order (it equalled ascending in every D28 image, so \"table vs sorted\"\n  is still untested -- if they ever differ, table order is the reading of \"sequence\"; `_set`/`_names` stay SORTED).\"\"\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"- **json list output**: sort + compact\"\"\",\"\"\"- **fmt-word collision (D28 MISS)**: lib already HAD fmt `disk` -- meaning virtual-disk containers -- while the GM used\n  `disk` for a raw GPT image; the GPT walk existed under `gpt`/`mbr`. Same lesson as D25 `registry`/`regf`: when the\n  fmt word hits a lib module, still check that module's detection matches today's MAGIC; else grep the field's last\n  words (`start_lba`, `partition`) across every prebuilt module and alias it.\n- **json list output**: sort + compact\"\"\",1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nwc -l reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3790,"cache_read_input_tokens":91488,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3790},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"67330609-5f2c-47f9-82d7-b8e9009ff7b1","uuid":"47629c17-e7d7-410f-b88d-1dddd90b34c8","timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:10:13.620Z","request_id":"req_011CgUgxZz9wuKWXchsuLoBD","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01XZSpLYosSC5n6WAKSdif8f":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reference/techniques/metadata-forensics.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=s.index(\"**Days 15-26**\"); b=s.index(\"## GM answer conventions learned\")\nold=s[a:b]\ni=old.index(\"Timed\\nD15-17 + D19\")\nnew=old[:i].replace(\"**Days 15-26**\",\"**Days 15-27**\") + \"\"\"D27 \"Packet\nLoss Prevention\" `pcap.packet_count` (24-B global hdr, then 16-B rec hdrs by incl_len @+8 to EOF; byte order + us/ns\nfrom the magic; snapped records count; prebuilt race hit ~22 s). Timed D15-17 + D19: synthesis dispatch missing ->\ngeneralize; D18, D20-22, D24-27 first try.\n\n**Day 28 — Where It All Began** (`disk.partition_start_lba_sequence`, kind `json` \"compact valid JSON array with exact\nvalues and order\", norm `trim`, id `d28-disk-001-disk-partition-start-lba-sequence`). Prompt: \"Disk images hold every\nprevious artifact family in context. Recover partition layouts, locate evidence by offset, and prove which image was\nrebuilt from an incomplete source.\" Title pun = where each partition BEGINS (start LBA) / LBA 0, where a disk begins.\n- Artifact: `metadata-day-2